('math-angle-measure-01','mathematics','trigonometry','Trigonometric functions','Angle measure','Convert 150° to radians.','["5π/6","3π/4","2π/3","7π/6"]',0,'Multiply degrees by π/180: 150π/180=5π/6.','foundation',array['jee-main','tg-eapcet','ap-eapcet'],'published','NCERT Mathematics XI; official JEE Main and EAPCET syllabi',now(),'codex-phase3-review','1.0'),
