('math-cosine-rule-01','mathematics','trigonometry','Triangle properties','Cosine rule','Which is the cosine rule for side a opposite angle A?','["a²=b²+c²−2bc cosA","a²=b²+c²+2bc cosA","a=b+c−2bc cosA","a²=b²−c²"]',0,'The cosine rule generalises Pythagoras: a²=b²+c²−2bc cosA.','foundation',array['jee-main','tg-eapcet','ap-eapcet'],'published','NCERT Mathematics XI; official JEE Main and EAPCET syllabi',now(),'codex-phase3-review','1.0'),
('math-projection-rule-01','mathematics','trigonometry','Triangle properties','Projection rule','Which projection identity is valid in triangle ABC?','["a=b cosC+c cosB","a=b sinC+c sinB","a=b cosB+c cosC","a²=b cosC+c cosB"]',0,'Projecting sides b and c onto side a gives a=b cosC+c cosB.','standard',array['jee-main','tg-eapcet','ap-eapcet'],'published','NCERT Mathematics XI; official JEE Main and EAPCET syllabi',now(),'codex-phase3-review','1.0'),
('math-triangle-half-angle-01','mathematics','trigonometry','Triangle properties','Half-angle formulae','For a triangle with semiperimeter s, sin(A/2) equals:','["√((s−b)(s−c)/(bc))","√(s(s−a)/(bc))","√((s−a)/s)","(b+c−a)/2"]',0,'The triangle half-angle identity is sin(A/2)=√(((s−b)(s−c))/(bc)).','advanced',array['jee-main','tg-eapcet','ap-eapcet'],'published','NCERT Mathematics XI; official JEE Main and EAPCET syllabi',now(),'codex-phase3-review','1.0'),
('math-triangle-area-incircle-01','mathematics','trigonometry','Triangle properties','Area, in-circle and ex-circles','If r is the inradius and s is the semiperimeter of a triangle, its area Δ is:','["rs","r/s","2rs","r²s"]',0,'The triangle splits into three triangles of height r, giving Δ=rs.','foundation',array['jee-main','tg-eapcet','ap-eapcet'],'published','NCERT Mathematics XI; official JEE Main and EAPCET syllabi',now(),'codex-phase3-review','1.0'),
('math-hyperbolic-definitions-01','mathematics','trigonometry','Hyperbolic functions','Definitions and graphs','sinh x is defined as:','["(eˣ−e⁻ˣ)/2","(eˣ+e⁻ˣ)/2","eˣ−e⁻ˣ","1/(eˣ+e⁻ˣ)"]',0,'By definition, sinhx=(eˣ−e⁻ˣ)/2.','foundation',array['tg-eapcet','ap-eapcet'],'published','State-board Intermediate Mathematics; official EAPCET syllabi',now(),'codex-phase3-review','1.0'),
